WEBVTT

00:00:57.929 --> 00:01:02.683
and had— in the best of cases— 
about a 40% survival rate.

00:01:03.851 --> 00:01:08.689
The European plague doctor, with his
beaked mask and wizard-like robes,

00:01:08.856 --> 00:01:13.444
is one of the images most popularly
associated with plague today.

00:01:13.653 --> 00:01:17.990
He’s often found in books and films 
about the 14th century pandemic

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:19.909
known as the Black Death.

00:01:20.368 --> 00:01:23.579
The only problem is
that’s about as accurate as placing

00:01:23.579 --> 00:01:28.209
a modern surgeon at the court
of Louis the 14th in Versailles.

00:01:28.292 --> 00:01:30.711
The confusion is understandable though—